---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<BaseLayout title="Blog">
  <div dir="ltr">
    <h1>Blog</h1>
    <p class="dim">Writings on the letters, as they come.</p>
    <section class="letter-card blog-highlight">
      <p class="label dim small">2 NOVEMBER 2026</p>
      <p class="name"><a href={`${base}blog/letter-tet/`}>Letter Tet</a></p>
      <p>We do not need to be perfect — on the old self we destroy, hearing yourself, and the balance of Tet.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="letter-card blog-highlight">
      <p class="label dim small">1 NOVEMBER 2026</p>
      <p class="name"><a href={`${base}blog/nun-letter-of-the-month/`}>Nun: The Letter That Writes What It Smells</a></p>
      <p>Nun is this month's letter — smell more, write more, and become what you fear.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
